{
  "_comment": "Toronto Events dashboard v2. Sections: filters, at-a-glance scores, two live feeds (today / next 3 days), where+what breakdowns, and momentum. `kind` selects the component: chart (uses the matching entry in reports_toronto_events.json), heading, list, filter. Coordinates are on a 48-column grid.",
